Run this command in your terminal in the directory OpenShot was downloaded to verify the SHA256 checksum:
  echo "32d5e55b447fd155f3f193ec36efe47e1f57f02a5f2090bdf3ef7b0bc7c8bcfd  OpenShot-v4.0.1-x86_64.dmg" | shasum -a 256 --check

You should get the following output:
  OpenShot-v4.0.1-x86_64.dmg: OK